                                "sense_id": "4c3e316f-0f87-30c8-b8a9-77a47b0c364e",
                                "text": "This cooking's so different he says, from their Bangla cooking."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "61d2efb2-7bdc-4c45-89ba-a7a4f5e609dc",
                                "sense_id": "4c3e316f-0f87-30c8-b8a9-77a47b0c364e",
                                "text": "After a gap of two years caused by the Covid 19 pandemic, the Bangla new year Pohela Boisakh was celebrated across Bangladesh on Thursday, April 14 with enthusiasm and festivity."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5157a7b9-19e5-4283-9e1d-ea6f61676829",
                                "sense_id": "4c3e316f-0f87-30c8-b8a9-77a47b0c364e",
                                "text": "On Friday, Bengalis will welcome 1429 as per Bangla calendar"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
